d:Torven Ordnance's code-signing service promotes the master arming image only on a valid ECDSA signature (secp256k1) over one exact message — and it will not sign that message for you. But it publishes signed release receipts. Use them to authorize the master image yourself.

<br>

The API is self-describing at `GET /schema`. Interact only with your assigned instance.

<br>

Flag format: **`CSCTF{...}`**
